  "metadata": {
    "source": "concept_agent",
    "requirements": "This model represents some entities of a course. \nWe know that courses have a name and a specific number of credits. Each course can have one or more professors, who have a name.\nProfessors could participate in any number of courses. For a course to exist, it must aggregate, at least, five students, where each student has a name. Students can be enrolled in any number of courses. Finally, students can be accommodated in dormitories, where each dormitory can have from one to four students. Besides, each dormitory has a price.",
